d OCU Sign Up Enter to Learn. Go Forth to Serve. Connect 138 North Lucretia Street, Oakland City, Indiana 47660 (800) 737-5125 Map & Directions Explore News & Events Calendar Bands Student Portal Faculty Portal Give Resources Career Services Library Directory Request Info Visit Apply ©2026 OCU Current Students Faculty/Staff Forms Accessibility Copyright Privacy Jobs"
